{"version":1,"content":"<p>澳洲通訊局（ASD）周二（27日）發表年度網絡脅報告，形容人工智能（AI）帶來「前所未見」威脅，警告外國政府利用AI入侵電腦網絡和關鍵基礎設施，也有助惡意行為的人更快找到系統漏洞並加以利用。</p><p>當局過去一年共發出超過4400次關於潛在惡意活動的警告，按年大增八成。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:39.638433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:28:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:15.790845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:11.246422+00:00","content_hash":"b2d7dcc36f5059e0c4ecb57531c87f41fc2d5646d790fff1217c1375060bafba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}